orks during interviews, exams, meetings, or anything on your screen. Invisible to screen recordings and proctoring software.**\n19: \n20: ---\n21: \n22: ## ✨ Features\n23: \n24: - 👻 **Ultimat\n<truncated 4175 bytes>\n vision provider (Gemini / Groq) |\n117: | **Scroll / UI** | `Alt + ↑` / `↓` | Scroll AI suggestions (hold for continuous) |\n118: | | `Home` / `End` | Jump to top / bottom |\n119: | | `Alt + Left / Right` | Move overlay window horizontally |\n120: | | `Alt + I` / `J` | Move overlay window up / down |\n121: | **AI / Audio** | `Alt + Q` / `W` | Switch to primary / secondary LLM |\n122: | | `Alt + E` | Auto-select fastest available LLM |\n123: | | `Alt + M` | Toggle microphone mute |\n124: | | `Alt + U` | Toggle universal mute (pause all) |\n125: | | `Alt + O` | Reset interview session |\n126: \n127: ---\n128: \n129: ## 🔧 Configuration\n130: \n131: All settings are stored in `.env`. The app creates this automatically on first launch.\n132: \n133: ```env\n134: # ─── API Keys ───\n135: DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=\"your_key\"\n136: \n137: # ─── AI Behaviour ───\n138: TRACK_CANDIDATE_RESPONSES=true\n139: INCLUDE_CONVERSATION_HISTORY=true\n140: GENERATE_FULL_ANSWERS=true\n141: PERSONALIZE_ANSWERS=true\n142: \n143: # ─── Scroll Speed ───\n144: SCROLL_SPEED_PX=200\n145: SCROLL_INTERVAL_MS=50\n146: ```\n147: \n148: ---\n149: \n150: ## 🤝 Contributing\n151: \n152: Pull requests are welcome! \n153: 1. Fork the repository\n154: 2. Create your feature branch (`git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature`)\n155: 3. Commit your changes (`git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'`)\n156: 4. Push to the branch (`git push origin feature/AmazingFeature`)\n157: 5. Open a Pull Request.\n158: \n159: ---\n160: \n161: ## ⚠️ Disclaimer\n162: \n163: **This tool is provided for educational and research purposes only.** Users are solely responsible for complying with the policies, terms of service, and regulations of any institution, exam provider, or employer. The developers of Spectra assume no li