{"step_index":365,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T16:02:15Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-21T13:02:15-03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-21T13:02:20-03:00\nThe search for \"\"LockedIn AI\" features \"stealth\" \"teleprompter\" \"human\" \"resume\" \"pricing\"\" returned the following summary:\nLockedIn AI is an AI-powered interview and meeting assistant platform designed to provide real-time support to job seekers[1][2][3]. Below is a breakdown of its features, \"stealth\" capabilities, human integration, and pricing.\n\n### **Core Features**\n*   **Real-Time Interview Copilot:** The platform listens to live interview questions and generates suggested responses, code solutions, or technical support in real-time[1][4][5].\n*   **\"Stealth\" Mode:** LockedIn AI features a dedicated desktop app designed for privacy during screen sharing[4][6]. It is built to remain invisible to interviewers and proctoring software by:\n    *   **Hiding from UI:** It does not appear on the taskbar, dock, or window switchers[7][6].\n    *   **Process Masking:** It can alias its process name (e.g., to \"Ghost.exe\") to blend into system activity monitors[7][6].\n    *   **Transparency Controls:** Users can adjust the overlay’s opacity[7][6].\n    *   **Global Hotkeys:** Interaction is managed through OS-level shortcuts rather than browser clicks, keeping the tool undetectable[7][6].\n*   **\"LockedIn Duo\" (Human Integration):** This feature allows a trusted human mentor or friend to join the session remotely[1][8]. The human helper can provide live tips, voice-to-text coaching, or \"Hands-on Assist,\" which allows them to offer temporary screen guidance[7][6].\n*   **Resume & Career Support:** The platform includes tools for resume building, job search assistance, and mock interviews to help candidates prepare before the actual interview[1][3][9].\n*   **Teleprompter Functionality:** While often described as a \"copilot\" or \"assistant,\" its inter